<title>USA: New York physical copper market - June 12.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - June 12.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for June shipment were quoted at a nominal 123.85 to 124.60 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 99.00 cents per lb, up one cent from June 11th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
